        "Before uploading you must rename/rearrange the columns to Comment, Designator, Footprint, JLCPCB Part #",
        "KiCad writes headers Ref, PosX, PosY, Rot, Side, which you then rename to Designator, Mid X, Mid Y, Rotation, Layer for JLCPCB."
